# Folders' reading of archives in a walled-off helper: the reasons given when the helper's answer cannot be used (src/files/unarchive.rs).

## Archive reader (src/files/unarchive.rs)

# Reason given when the walled-off helper that reads an archive sent back something that cannot be understood.
folders-unarchive-bad-frame = Folders couldn't understand what it read from the archive
# Reason given when the walled-off helper that reads an archive found it damaged.
folders-unarchive-damaged = the archive is damaged
